        {
          "display_order": 4,
          "entry_type": "elos",
          "raw_reference": "\u00a7 23.613(c); 23.615 \u2013 Materials and their characteristics according to \u010cSN and aviation specifications have been used for aircraft design and construction. It is admitted with regard to the fact that an intent of the requirement is met.",
